SUMMARY:Finish Strong and Position Your Business for Growth
DESCRIPTION:Montclair Business Networking\nYear-end has a way of sneaking 
 up on business owners. You’re focused on finishing the year strong while
  budgets need attention\, next year’s marketing plan is taking shape\, s
 taffing decisions are looming\, and new growth goals are already on the ta
 ble.\nBefore you start setting goals for 2027\, there are some bigger ques
 tions worth asking:\n\n* What drove your growth this year and where did yo
 u fall short?\n\n* Does your team have the capacity and skills to support 
 where you want to go?\n\n* Are your marketing\, financial\, and operationa
 l plans working together toward the same goals?\n\nJoin us on October 13th
  and we’ll help you unpack it.\nThe panel discussion brings together exp
 erts in business growth\, marketing\, HR\, and accounting to help you buil
 d a stronger foundation for the year ahead.\nTopics include:\n\n* 2026 Per
 formance Review: What your financial results\, marketing performance\, and
  workforce health say about where your business stands.\n\n* 2027 Growth P
 lanning: Marketing\, financial\, and workforce decisions to make now as yo
 u set your goals for the new year.\n\n* Execution Readiness: The people\, 
 processes\, systems\, and financial foundation you need in place to carry 
 out your plan.\n\nWho Should Attend?\n\n* Business owners and entrepreneur
 s\n\n* CEOs and senior leaders\n\n* Sales and marketing leaders\n\n* HR an
 d people leaders\n\n* Business development professionals\n\n* Anyone respo
 nsible for helping their organization grow in 2027\n\nDon’t wait until J
 anuary to figure out what 2027 should look like. Use this session to take 
 stock of where your business stands\, identify what needs attention\, and 
 head into the new year ready to act.\nReserve your spot!
